      "name": "Improved Grab",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>To use this ability, the dread tree must hit an opponent at least one size category smaller than itself with its slam attack. If it gets a hold, it automatically deals slam damage each round that the hold is maintained, and it can smash in the next round (see below).</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/menacecreat1.html",
